<https://w3id.org/laad/grafo/argumentacion/R-papelito-simon-arce> {
    <https://w3id.org/laad/id/creencia/R-papelito-simon-arce> a crminf:I2_Belief ;
        crminf:J4_that <https://w3id.org/laad/grafo/reconstruccion/R-papelito-simon-arce> ;
